await finishSheet(dir,19,['Rejected diagnostic candidate.','HERITAGE fine modulation only.','Coarse attenuation stays at l18.','Bell fixes the combined column mean.','Published 56 arcsec input pixels.','Diffuse layer remains 250 pc.','Finite molecular clouds are retained.','No molecular column is added twice.','Dust strength remains 0.25 to 2.','Every light source stays at l18.','Fine dark texture is insufficient.','No photo structure enters the dust.']);
